  "_readme": "DESIGN TOKENS. Every color, font, radius, shadow and motion value the site uses lives here. Edit and refresh: tokens are read server-side per request and emitted as CSS custom properties, so no rebuild is needed. `palettes.light` and `palettes.dark` each hold the full color set; dark applies when the visitor's system prefers it or they pick it with the header toggle. Steel-blue neutrals (hue 205 to 210), one deep-blue accent for links, buttons and focus, and an orange `signal` reserved for live-status marks and never used for text. Text colors clear 4.5:1 against every background and surface in both palettes (light worst 5.05:1, dark worst 5.66:1); `controlBorder` clears 3:1. Re-check after changing any of them.",
